IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ecpoja-assistance`

-- Evidence (Civil Proceedings in Other Jurisdictions) Act 1979, ss 2 to 5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_evidence-civil-proceedings-in-other-jurisdictions-act-1979.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a foreign court's request in a contract suit` MEANS Application WITH
    `made to the General Division of the High Court` IS TRUE
    `seeks evidence to be obtained in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `made pursuant to a request by or on behalf of a court or tribunal` IS TRUE
    `the requesting court sits outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the matter is civil or commercial` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings arise out of a fiscal, monetary or revenue law` IS FALSE
    `the proceedings are instituted or contemplated` IS TRUE

